    }
  ],
  "sourceCensusScope": "Syntax counts include all listed constructs; PostfixExpression also includes increment/decrement. Direct candidates cover final variable initializers with cast/assert wrappers and root pattern-variable/case initializers terminating in a declared function/method/constructor reference or function/implicit-call reference. The detector excludes call results and does not census stable alias chains, nested extraction or every if/switch input. Zero direct candidates is not proof of absent callable behavior.",
